      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure unity is capable of sending audio from multiple audio listeners through different outputs. \n\nThis may be entirely up to the streamer to utilise the stereo mix, pass it through their audio processing application of choice, flip the stereo channels, then output that flipped audio back into their streaming software anytime they are using the streaming camera in such a way that the audio should be reversed for viewer comfort.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
